{
  "_doc": [
    "Behaviour scenarios for the layout of the demo site (examples/demo): sidebar (collapse, hover, drawer), sidebar scroll area, table of contents and the collapsible table of contents. Format: see the header of verify/behaviour.mjs.",
    "Paths are demo site paths. Against a reference app, pass its rewrites file; for a self comparison use the same base URL on both sides with --no-rewrite.",
    "The 4 px hover zone of the collapsed sidebar is approached with a real mouse pointer: React implements onPointerEnter through pointerover, so a dispatched pointerenter doesn't reach the reference. It is the first child of [data-sidebar-placeholder] in both versions.",
    "Numbers measured in the middle of a transition (height, opacity, grid-template-columns) and getAnimations().currentTime fluctuate even when the reference is compared with itself; the scenarios therefore check attributes and custom properties at frame0 and settled.",
    "Class independent: selectors use ids, data attributes, roles and structure only, and `class` is never observed. What the class list used to show is observed as a computed style in styleProps (translate, rotate, box-shadow, opacity, visibility, color, transition-property).",
    "The demo sidebar has no nested folders, so the folder open and close scenarios of a larger site have no demo equivalent."
  ],
  "scenarios": [
    {
      "name": "sidebar-collapse",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "button[data-collapsed]", "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar", "#nd-notebook-layout"],
        "attributes": ["data-collapsed", "data-hovered", "data-sidebar-collapsed", "data-column-changed"],
        "styleProps": ["--fd-sidebar-col", "transition-property", "box-shadow", "border-top-left-radius", "visibility"],
        "animations": false
      },
      "sample": ["frame0", "settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "sidebar-edge-hover",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "button[data-collapsed]" },
        { "wait": 500 },
        { "hover": "[data-sidebar-placeholder] > div", "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar"],
        "attributes": ["data-collapsed", "data-hovered"],
        "styleProps": ["translate", "box-shadow", "transition-property"],
        "animations": true
      },
      "sample": ["frame0", "frame1", "animationend", "settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "sidebar-leave-far",
      "_purpose": "Pointer further than 100 px from the edge: 0 ms delay.",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "button[data-collapsed]" },
        { "wait": 500 },
        { "hover": "[data-sidebar-placeholder] > div" },
        { "wait": 400 },
        { "hover": "#nd-page h1" },
        { "wait": 60, "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar"],
        "attributes": ["data-hovered"],
        "styleProps": ["box-shadow"]
      },
      "sample": ["frame0", "settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "sidebar-leave-near",
      "_purpose": "Pointer closer than 100 px to the edge (header on the left): 500 ms delay.",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "button[data-collapsed]" },
        { "wait": 500 },
        { "hover": "[data-sidebar-placeholder] > div" },
        { "wait": 400 },
        { "hover": "#nd-subnav a" },
        { "wait": 300, "sample": true },
        { "wait": 400, "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar"],
        "attributes": ["data-hovered"],
        "styleProps": ["box-shadow"]
      },
      "sample": ["frame0"]
    },
    {
      "name": "sidebar-expand",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "button[data-collapsed]" },
        { "wait": 600 },
        { "click": "button[data-collapsed]", "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar", "#nd-notebook-layout"],
        "attributes": ["data-collapsed", "data-hovered", "data-sidebar-collapsed", "data-column-changed"],
        "styleProps": ["--fd-sidebar-col", "transition-property", "box-shadow", "border-top-left-radius", "visibility"],
        "animations": false
      },
      "sample": ["frame0", "settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "sidebar-collapsed-reload",
      "_purpose": "After a reload the reference starts expanded (useState(false)); a stored state must not come back. With the sidebar collapsed the column geometry is an intentional difference from the reference (Luka's decision, 2026-09-13), so grid-template-columns is not observed; state, --fd-sidebar-col and translate stay strict.",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "button[data-collapsed]" },
        { "wait": 600 },
        { "evaluate": "location.reload()" },
        { "wait": 1500 },
        { "waitFor": "#nd-notebook-layout", "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar", "#nd-notebook-layout", "button[data-collapsed]"],
        "attributes": ["data-collapsed", "data-hovered", "data-sidebar-collapsed", "data-column-changed"],
        "styleProps": ["--fd-sidebar-col", "translate", "box-shadow", "visibility"],
        "animations": false
      },
      "sample": ["settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "sidebar-collapsed-navigation",
      "_purpose": "Page change through a link: the reference keeps the collapsed state (client navigation), without a transition. With the sidebar collapsed the column geometry is an intentional difference from the reference (Luka's decision, 2026-09-13), so grid-template-columns is not observed; state, --fd-sidebar-col and translate stay strict.",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "button[data-collapsed]" },
        { "wait": 600 },
        { "click": "#nd-page > div:last-of-type > a[href]" },
        { "wait": 2000 },
        { "waitFor": "#nd-notebook-layout", "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar", "#nd-notebook-layout", "button[data-collapsed]"],
        "attributes": ["data-collapsed", "data-hovered", "data-sidebar-collapsed", "data-column-changed"],
        "styleProps": ["--fd-sidebar-col", "translate", "box-shadow", "visibility"],
        "animations": false
      },
      "sample": ["settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "sidebar-collapsed-search",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "button[data-collapsed]" },
        { "wait": 600 },
        { "click": "button[data-search-full]", "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar", "#nd-notebook-layout", "[role=dialog]"],
        "attributes": ["data-collapsed", "data-hovered", "data-sidebar-collapsed", "data-open"],
        "styleProps": ["--fd-sidebar-col", "translate", "opacity"],
        "scrollLocked": true
      },
      "sample": ["settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "sidebar-collapsed-theme",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "button[data-collapsed]" },
        { "wait": 600 },
        { "click": "button[data-theme-toggle]", "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar", "#nd-notebook-layout"],
        "attributes": ["data-collapsed", "data-hovered", "data-sidebar-collapsed"],
        "styleProps": ["--fd-sidebar-col", "translate", "background-color", "border-top-color"],
        "html": true,
        "storage": ["theme"]
      },
      "sample": ["settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "short-window-active-entry",
      "_purpose": "On load the active entry is scrolled into the visible area of the sidebar.",
      "page": "/reference/markdown-extras",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 520,
      "actions": [
        { "wait": 600, "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar [data-id$='-viewport']", "#nd-sidebar a[data-active='true']"],
        "attributes": ["tabindex", "data-has-overflow-y", "data-overflow-y-start", "data-overflow-y-end"],
        "styleProps": ["--scroll-area-overflow-y-start", "--scroll-area-overflow-y-end"]
      },
      "sample": ["settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "sidebar-scroll-and-hover",
      "_purpose": "The scrollbar appears only on overflow and becomes visible on hover; thumb size from the scroll measurements.",
      "page": "/reference/markdown-extras",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 520,
      "actions": [
        { "scroll": "#nd-sidebar [data-id$='-viewport']", "y": 200 },
        { "wait": 150 },
        { "hover": "#nd-sidebar [data-id$='-viewport']" },
        { "wait": 200, "sample": true },
        { "wait": 600, "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar [data-id$='-scrollbar']", "#nd-sidebar [data-id$='-scrollbar'] > div", "#nd-sidebar [data-id$='-viewport']"],
        "attributes": ["data-orientation", "data-hovering", "data-scrolling", "data-has-overflow-y", "aria-hidden"],
        "styleProps": ["--scroll-area-thumb-height", "opacity", "height", "transform", "--scroll-area-overflow-y-start"]
      },
      "sample": ["frame0"]
    },
    {
      "name": "toc-third-heading",
      "_purpose": "data-active, --track-top/--track-bottom and the scroll position in the table of contents.",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1440,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "evaluate": "document.querySelectorAll('#nd-page h2[id],#nd-page h3[id]')[2].scrollIntoView()" },
        { "wait": 900, "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-toc a[href^='#']", "#nd-toc div:has(> a[href^='#']) > div:first-child", "#nd-toc div:has(> a[href^='#']) > div:first-child > svg"],
        "attributes": ["data-active", "style", "viewBox"],
        "styleProps": ["--track-top", "--track-bottom", "clip-path", "color"]
      },
      "sample": ["settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "toc-popover-open",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "[data-toc-popover-trigger]", "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": [
          "[data-toc-popover]",
          "[data-toc-popover] > header",
          "[data-toc-popover-trigger]",
          "[data-toc-popover-trigger] > span > span",
          "[data-toc-popover-trigger] svg[role='progressbar']",
          "[data-toc-popover-content]",
          "[data-toc-popover-trigger] svg:not([role])"
        ],
        "attributes": ["data-open", "data-closed", "data-starting-style", "data-ending-style", "aria-expanded", "aria-valuenow"],
        "styleProps": ["--collapsible-panel-height", "box-shadow", "opacity", "translate", "color", "rotate"],
        "animations": false,
        "text": true
      },
      "sample": ["frame0", "settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "toc-popover-outside-click",
      "_purpose": "A click outside the header closes; a real mouse click would hit the panel, so a click event is dispatched on the heading.",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "[data-toc-popover-trigger]" },
        { "wait": 500 },
        { "evaluate": "document.querySelector('#nd-page h1').dispatchEvent(new MouseEvent('click',{bubbles:true}))", "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["[data-toc-popover]", "[data-toc-popover] > header", "[data-toc-popover-trigger] svg:not([role])"],
        "attributes": ["data-open", "data-closed", "data-ending-style", "aria-expanded"],
        "styleProps": ["box-shadow", "rotate"],
        "animations": false
      },
      "sample": ["frame0", "settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "toc-popover-progress",
      "_purpose": "The ring shows (last active entry + 1) / count; circumference 2*PI*7.5.",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 1024,
      "height": 900,
      "actions": [
        { "evaluate": "window.scrollTo(0, 2000)" },
        { "wait": 900, "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": [
          "[data-toc-popover-trigger] svg[role='progressbar']",
          "[data-toc-popover-trigger] svg[role='progressbar'] circle:nth-of-type(2)",
          "[data-toc-popover-trigger] > span > span"
        ],
        "attributes": ["aria-valuenow", "stroke-dasharray", "stroke-dashoffset"],
        "text": true,
        "styleProps": ["color", "opacity", "translate"]
      },
      "sample": ["settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "drawer-open",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 844,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "[aria-controls='nd-sidebar-mobile']", "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar-mobile", "#nd-notebook-layout > div[data-state]", "[data-sidebar-placeholder]", "[aria-controls='nd-sidebar-mobile']"],
        "attributes": ["data-state", "aria-expanded", "aria-label"],
        "styleProps": ["animation-name", "animation-duration", "visibility"],
        "animations": false
      },
      "sample": ["frame0", "settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "drawer-overlay-click",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 844,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "[aria-controls='nd-sidebar-mobile']" },
        { "wait": 500 },
        { "evaluate": "document.querySelector('#nd-notebook-layout > div[data-state]').click()", "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar-mobile", "#nd-notebook-layout > div[data-state]"],
        "attributes": ["data-state"],
        "styleProps": ["animation-name", "animation-duration", "visibility"],
        "animations": false
      },
      "sample": ["frame0", "settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "drawer-close-button",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 844,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "[aria-controls='nd-sidebar-mobile']" },
        { "wait": 500 },
        { "click": "#nd-sidebar-mobile [aria-controls='nd-sidebar-mobile']", "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar-mobile", "#nd-notebook-layout > div[data-state]", "[aria-controls='nd-sidebar-mobile']"],
        "attributes": ["data-state", "aria-expanded", "aria-label"],
        "styleProps": ["animation-name", "animation-duration", "visibility"],
        "animations": false
      },
      "sample": ["frame0", "settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "drawer-alignment",
      "_purpose": "The drawer sits at the inline end, 85 % wide, at most 380 px; Esc does NOT close it.",
      "page": "/reference/code-blocks",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 844,
      "actions": [
        { "click": "[aria-controls='nd-sidebar-mobile']" },
        { "wait": 500 },
        { "press": "Escape" },
        { "wait": 300, "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar-mobile"],
        "attributes": ["data-state"],
        "styleProps": ["width", "inset-inline-end", "inset-block-start", "max-width", "visibility", "z-index"]
      },
      "sample": ["settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "drawer-scroll-position-first-section",
      "_purpose": "After loading at 390 px the drawer stays at the top when the active entry is visible. The reference measures the if-needed check when the animation starts (fd-sidebar-out at 0 ms); a shifted sidebar would let the entry overflow the window edge and scroll.",
      "page": "/guide/installation",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 844,
      "actions": [
        { "wait": 1500, "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar-mobile [data-id$='-viewport']"],
        "attributes": ["data-has-overflow-y", "data-overflow-y-start", "data-overflow-y-end", "tabindex"],
        "styleProps": ["--scroll-area-overflow-y-start", "--scroll-area-overflow-y-end"]
      },
      "sample": ["settled"]
    },
    {
      "name": "drawer-scroll-position-last-entry",
      "_purpose": "The last entry of the tree is active; the automatic scroll runs for every active entry in tree order, the last one wins.",
      "page": "/reference/markdown-extras",
      "width": 390,
      "height": 844,
      "actions": [
        { "wait": 1500, "sample": true }
      ],
      "observe": {
        "selectors": ["#nd-sidebar-mobile [data-id$='-viewport']"],
        "attributes": ["data-has-overflow-y", "data-overflow-y-start", "data-overflow-y-end", "tabindex"],
        "styleProps": ["--scroll-area-overflow-y-start", "--scroll-area-overflow-y-end"]
      },
      "sample": ["settled"]
    }
  ]
}
